sequenceDiagram
  participant C as Client
  participant E as Cloudflare Edge
  participant A as platform-api
  participant R as Runtime
  participant M as MongoDB
  participant O as Outbox
  participant K as MSK
  C->>E: Intent + idempotency key
  E->>A: Authenticated request ID
  A->>M: Load scoped state and definition
  A->>R: Evaluate deterministic plan
  R-->>A: Plan or denial
  A->>M: Commit state, receipt, ledger, audit, outbox
  A-->>C: Receipt and new version
  O->>K: Publish committed event
